  "text": "<h2 id=\"Personal_life\">Personal life</h2>\n<h2 id=\"Career\">Career</h2>\n<h3 id=\"Early_career\">Early career</h3>\n<h3 id=\"2003–04_season:_Junior_Grand_Prix_debut\"><span id=\"2003.E2.80.9304_season:_Junior_Grand_Prix_debut\"></span>2003–04 season: Junior Grand Prix debut</h3>\n<h3 id=\"2004–05_season:_JGPF_and_Junior_World_Silver\"><span id=\"2004.E2.80.9305_season:_JGPF_and_Junior_World_Silver\"></span>2004–05 season: JGPF and Junior World Silver</h3>\n<h3 id=\"2005–06_season:_Junior_Grand_Prix_and_World_Junior_titles\"><span id=\"2005.E2.80.9306_season:_Junior_Grand_Prix_and_World_Junior_titles\"></span>2005–06 season: Junior Grand Prix and World Junior titles</h3>\n<h3 id=\"2006–07_season:_Grand_Prix_debut\"><span id=\"2006.E2.80.9307_season:_Grand_Prix_debut\"></span>2006–07 season: Grand Prix debut</h3>\n<h3 id=\"2007–08_season:_Four_Continents_title_and_World_Silver\"><span id=\"2007.E2.80.9308_season:_Four_Continents_title_and_World_Silver\"></span>2007–08 season: Four Continents title and World Silver</h3>\n<h3 id=\"2008–09_season:_Injury_and_World_Bronze\"><span id=\"2008.E2.80.9309_season:_Injury_and_World_Bronze\"></span>2008–09 season: Injury and World Bronze</h3>\n<h3 id=\"2009–10_season:_Olympic_and_World_titles\"><span id=\"2009.E2.80.9310_season:_Olympic_and_World_titles\"></span>2009–10 season: Olympic and World titles</h3>\n<h3 id=\"2010–11_season:_Injury_and_World_Silver\"><span id=\"2010.E2.80.9311_season:_Injury_and_World_Silver\"></span>2010–11 season: Injury and World Silver</h3>\n<h3 id=\"2011–12_season:_Second_Four_Continents_and_World_titles\"><span id=\"2011.E2.80.9312_season:_Second_Four_Continents_and_World_titles\"></span>2011–12 season: Second Four Continents and World titles</h3>\n<h3 id=\"2012–13_season\"><span id=\"2012.E2.80.9313_season\"></span>2012–13 season</h3>\n<h3 id=\"2013–14_season:_Two_Olympic_silver_medals\"><span id=\"2013.E2.80.9314_season:_Two_Olympic_silver_medals\"></span>2013–14 season: Two Olympic silver medals</h3>\n<h3 id=\"2016–17_season:_Undefeated_comeback_season_and_coaching_change\"><span id=\"2016.E2.80.9317_season:_Undefeated_comeback_season_and_coaching_change\"></span>2016–17 season: Undefeated comeback season and coaching change</h3>\n<h3 id=\"2017–18_season:_Two_Olympic_gold_medals\"><span id=\"2017.E2.80.9318_season:_Two_Olympic_gold_medals\"></span>2017–18 season: Two Olympic gold medals</h3>\n<h2 id=\"Non-competitive_career\">Non-competitive career</h2>\n<h2 id=\"Records_and_achievements_(with_Moir)\"><span id=\"Records_and_achievements_.28with_Moir.29\"></span>Records and achievements (with Moir)</h2>\n<h3 id=\"List_of_world_record_scores_set_by_Virtue/Moir\"><span id=\"List_of_world_record_scores_set_by_Virtue.2FMoir\"></span>List of world record scores set by Virtue/Moir</h3>\n<h2 id=\"Awards_and_honours\">Awards and honours</h2>\n<h2 id=\"Programs\">Programs</h2>\n<h3 id=\"Post-2018\">Post-2018</h3>\n<h3 id=\"Pre-2018\">Pre-2018</h3>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Season\n</th>\n<th><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/wiki/Short_dance\" title=\"Short dance\">Short dance</a>\n</th>\n<th><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/wiki/Free_dance_(figure_skating)\" title=\"Free dance (figure skating)\">Free dance</a>\n</th>\n<th>Exhibition\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th>2017–2018 <br/><sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-Tessa_Virtue_and_Scott_Moir_SUN170830_125-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Tessa_Virtue_and_Scott_Moir_SUN170830-125\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>125<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</th>\n<td>\n<ul><li><span style=\"font-size: 85%;\">Samba:</span> <a href=\"/wiki/Sympathy_for_the_Devil\" title=\"Sympathy for the Devil\">Sympathy for the Devil</a> <br/><span style=\"font-size: 85%;\"> by <a href=\"/wiki/The_Rolling_Stones\" title=\"The Rolling Stones\">The Rolling Stones</a> </span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 85%;\">Rhumba:</span> <a href=\"/wiki/Hotel_California\" title=\"Hotel California\">Hotel California</a> <br/><span style=\"font-size: 85%;\"> by the <a href=\"/wiki/Eagles_(band)\" title=\"Eagles (band)\">Eagles</a> </span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 85%;\">Cha Cha:</span> <a href=\"/wiki/Oye_C%C3%B3mo_Va\" title=\"Oye Cómo Va\">Oye Cómo Va</a><br/><span style=\"font-size: 85%;\"> by <a href=\"/wiki/Santana_(band)\" title=\"Santana (band)\">Santana</a> </span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Moulin_Rouge!_Music_from_Baz_Luhrmann%27s_Film,_Vol._2\" title=\"Moulin Rouge! Music from Baz Luhrmann's Film, Vol. 2\">The Show Must Go On</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Moulin_Rouge!_Music_from_Baz_Luhrmann%27s_Film\" title=\"Moulin Rouge! Music from Baz Luhrmann's Film\">El Tango De Roxanne</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Come_What_May_(2001_song)\" title=\"Come What May (2001 song)\">Come What May</a> <br/><span style=\"font-size: 85%;\"> by <a href=\"/wiki/David_Baerwald\" title=\"David Baerwald\">David Baerwald</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Kevin_Gilbert_(musician)\" title=\"Kevin Gilbert (musician)\">Kevin Gilbert</a><br/> performed by <a href=\"/wiki/Ewan_McGregor\" title=\"Ewan McGregor\">Ewan McGregor</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Nicole_Kidman\" title=\"Nicole Kidman\">Nicole Kidman</a> <br/> choreo. by <a href=\"/wiki/Marie-France_Dubreuil\" title=\"Marie-France Dubreuil\">Marie-France Dubreuil</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/David_Wilson_(figure_skating)\" title=\"David Wilson (figure skating)\">David Wilson</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Samuel_Chouinard\" title=\"Samuel Chouinard\">Samuel Chouinard</a> </span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/I_Dreamed_a_Dream\" title=\"I Dreamed a Dream\">I Dreamed a Dream</a> <small>(from <i><a href=\"/wiki/Les_Mis%C3%A9rables_(2012_film)\" title=\"Les Misérables (2012 film)\">Les Misérables</a></i>) <br/>performed by <a href=\"/wiki/Anne_Hathaway\" title=\"Anne Hathaway\">Anne Hathaway</a> <br/> choreo. by Tessa Virtue, Scott Moir</small></li></ul>\n<hr/>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Moulin_Rouge