\">[</span>140<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> <br/><span style=\"font-size: 85%;\"> by <a href=\"/wiki/Georges_Bizet\" title=\"Georges Bizet\">Georges Bizet</a> </span></li></ul>\n<hr/>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Rise_Up_(Andra_Day_song)\" title=\"Rise Up (Andra Day song)\">Rise Up</a> <br/><span style=\"font-size: 85%;\"> by <a href=\"/wiki/Andra_Day\" title=\"Andra Day\">Andra Day</a> </span></li></ul>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th>2014–2015\n</th>\n<td align=\"centre\" colspan=\"2\">Did not compete this season\n</td>\n<td>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Say_It_Right\" title=\"Say It Right\">Say It Right</a><sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-Tessa_Virtue_and_Scott_Moir_IS150220_141-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Tessa_Virtue_and_Scott_Moir_IS150220-141\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>141<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> <br/><span style=\"font-size: 85%;\"> by <a href=\"/wiki/Nelly_Furtado\" title=\"Nelly Furtado\">Nelly Furtado</a> </span></li></ul>\n<hr/>\n<ul><li>Stay<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-Tessa_Virtue_and_Scott_Moir_IS150220_141-1\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Tessa_Virtue_and_Scott_Moir_IS150220-141\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>141<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> <br/><span style=\"font-size: 85%;\"> by <a href=\"/wiki/Rihanna\" title=\"Rihanna\">Rihanna</a> </span></li></ul>\n<hr/>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Good_Kisser\" title=\"Good Kisser\">Good Kisser</a><sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-Tessa_Virtue_and_Scott_Moir_HS150504_142-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Tessa_Virtue_and_Scott_Moir_HS150504-142\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>142<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-Tessa_Virtue_and_Scott_Moir_csoi2015music_143-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Tessa_Virtue_and_Scott_Moir_csoi2015music-143\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>143<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> <br/><span style=\"font-size: 85%;\"> by <a href=\"/wiki/Usher_(musician)\" ti